            "sid": "REV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An a Yohana, m’umegwu man jarib wakudu i masendi ku ker ku twiocwiny ma gini i Yesu, nwang’u ani i cula ma julwong’o Patmo, kum lembe pa Mungu man kum lembatuca pa Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u ani i Tipo i ceng’ pa Rwoth, e awinjo dwal ma dit yor i ng’eya, calu mir agwara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "m’uwacu kumae, Gin m’ineno, gor i kitabu man iore ba kanisa abiro: bang’ Efeso, ba Smurna de, ba Pergamo de, ba Thuatera de, ba Sardi de, ba Filadelfia de, man ba Laodikia bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man alokra nineno dwal m’uweco kuda. E kan alokra aneno thethala mi mola ma kwar abiro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 7:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.10.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 10:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man i kind thethala ng’atu acel ma calu wod dhanu, m’eronyo bongu lot wi tiende, ma kore de bedo atwia ku foto mola ma kwar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
